@startuml invitation-state
' Invitation lifecycle (Claude proposal). See design.md section 2 and data-model.md section 3.3.
title SplitSmart - Group Invitation Lifecycle (FR-002)
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> PENDING : manager invites email
PENDING --> ACCEPTED : invitee accepts\n[verified email matches]\n/ create Membership atomically
PENDING --> DECLINED : invitee declines
PENDING --> REVOKED : manager revokes
ACCEPTED --> [*]
DECLINED --> [*]
REVOKED --> [*]

PENDING : no access to group data
ACCEPTED : member gains access
note right of PENDING
  Expiry is undecided (OQ-26).
  At most one PENDING invitation
  per (group, email).
end note
@enduml
